  "summary_en": "Adra's strategic research and innovation agenda for EU Horizon Europe 2025-27 on AI, data and robotics. It sets a 2030 vision and six 'Big Tickets', including embodied-intelligence robots and compliance tools. It urges regulatory sandboxes, standardisation, testing facilities and compliance support to turn the AI Act and related rules into a competitive advantage.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Six Big Tickets, including next-generation robots with embodied intelligence and tools for compliance.",
   "Calls for regulatory sandboxes and large testbeds (TEFs) for real-world testing of autonomous systems.",
   "Urges pre-standardisation and European standards for modularity, certification and validation of robots.",
   "Authorities should give fast, clear guidance on AI Act, Cyber Resilience Act and Machinery rules, with compliance support for SMEs.",
   "Promotes strategic autonomy, skills development and innovation procurement."
